'''Eevee ex''' (Japanese: '''イーブイex''' ''Eievui ex'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

