==Trivia==
* This card is the first {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket that is capable of [[Evolution]] (via its {{TCG|Ability}}).
* This card's immersive illustration features {{p|Eevee}} and all [[Eeveelution]]s — {{p|Vaporeon}}, {{p|Jolteon}}, {{p|Flareon}}, {{p|Espeon}}, {{p|Umbreon}}, {{p|Leafeon}}, {{p|Glaceon}} and {{p|Sylveon}}.
* This card's promo illustration features {{p|Bulbasaur}}, {{p|Charmander}}, {{p|Squirtle}}, {{p|Pikachu}}, {{p|Chansey}}, {{p|Chikorita}}, {{p|Cyndaquil}}, {{p|Totodile}}, {{p|Delibird}}, {{p|Turtwig}}, {{p|Chimchar}}, {{p|Piplup}}, {{p|Rowlet}}, {{p|Litten}}, and {{p|Popplio}} along with Eevee.

===Origin===
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Eevee}} can learn.

